{"ref": "Shulchan Arukh, Yoreh De'ah 112:1", "heRef": "שולחן ערוך, יורה דעה קי״ב:א׳", "sectionRef": "Shulchan Arukh, Yoreh De'ah 112", "indexTitle": "Shulchan Arukh, Yoreh De'ah", "heIndexTitle": "שולחן ערוך, יורה דעה", "categories": ["Halakhah", "Shulchan Arukh"], "next": "Shulchan Arukh, Yoreh De'ah 113", "sectionNames": ["Siman", "Seif"], "versions": [{"language": "he", "languageFamilyName": "hebrew", "actualLanguage": "he", "versionTitle": "Ashlei Ravrevei: Shulchan Aruch Yoreh Deah, Lemberg, 1888", "license": "Public Domain", "versionSource": "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH002097765", "text": "<b>דיני פת של עובדי כוכבים. ובו ט\"ז סעיפים:</b><br><i data-commentator=\"Be'er HaGolah\" data-order=\"1\"></i>אסרו חכמים לאכול <i data-commentator=\"Siftei Kohen\" data-order=\"1\"></i>פת של עממים <i data-commentator=\"Siftei Kohen\" data-order=\"2\"></i>עובדי כוכבים <i data-commentator=\"Siftei Kohen\" data-order=\"3\"></i><i data-commentator=\"Beur HaGra\" data-order=\"1\"></i>משום <i data-commentator=\"Ba'er Hetev\" data-order=\"1\"></i><i data-commentator=\"Pithei Teshuva\" data-order=\"1\"></i>חתנות <i data-commentator=\"Turei Zahav\" data-order=\"1\"></i><i data-commentator=\"Siftei Kohen\" data-order=\"4\"></i><i data-commentator=\"Beur HaGra\" data-order=\"2\"></i><small>(ואפילו במקום דליכא משום חתנות אסור) (רשב\"א סימן רמ\"ח) </small><i data-commentator=\"Beur HaGra\" data-order=\"3\"></i><i data-commentator=\"Be'er HaGolah\" data-order=\"2\"></i>ולא אסרו <i data-commentator=\"Turei Zahav\" data-order=\"2\"></i>אלא פת של חמשת מיני <i data-commentator=\"Ba'er Hetev\" data-order=\"2\"></i>דגן אבל פת של קטנית ושל אורז ודוחן אינו בכלל פת סתם שאסרו: <small>הגה <i data-commentator=\"Siftei Kohen\" data-order=\"5\"></i><i data-commentator=\"Beur HaGra\" data-order=\"4\"></i>וגם אינו אסור משו' בישולי עובדי כוכבי' <i data-commentator=\"Turei Zahav\" data-order=\"3\"></i>אם אינו עולה על שלחן <i data-commentator=\"Ba'er Hetev\" data-order=\"3\"></i>מלכי' (טור וב\"י בשם תשו' הרא\"ש):</small>"}, {"language": "en", "languageFamilyName": "english", "actualLanguage": "en", "versionTitle": "Wikisource Shulchan Aruch - English", "license": "CC-BY-SA", "versionSource": "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Translation:Shulchan_Aruch/Yoreh_Deah/186", "text": "The sages forbade eating the bread of idol worshippers because of the concern of intermarriage. Rema: and even in a situation where there is no concern of intermarriage, it is [nonetheless] forbidden. (Rashb\"a §248) However, they only forbade bread made from the Five Grains (wheat, barley, oats, rye, spelt), but bread made from legumes or from rice or millet is not in the category of \"regular bread\" which they forbade. Rema: It is also not forbidden on account of [being] \"Idolaters' Cooking,\" if it would not be served at kings' tables (Tur and Beit Yosef in the name of the Rosh's responsa)."}], "available_versions": [{"language": "he", "languageFamilyName": "hebrew", "actualLanguage": "he", "versionTitle": "Ashlei Ravrevei: Shulchan Aruch Yoreh Deah, Lemberg, 1888", "license": "Public Domain", "versionSource": "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH002097765"}, {"language": "he", "languageFamilyName": "hebrew", "actualLanguage": "he", "versionTitle": "Torat Emet 357", "license": "Public Domain", "versionSource": "http://www.toratemetfreeware.com/index.html?downloads"}, {"language": "he", "languageFamilyName": "hebrew", "actualLanguage": "he", "versionTitle": "Wikisource Shulchan Aruch", "license": "CC-BY-SA", "versionSource": "http://he.wikisource.org/wiki/%D7%A9%D7%95%D7%9C%D7%97%D7%9F_%D7%A2%D7%A8%D7%95%D7%9A_%D7%90%D7%95%D7%A8%D7%97_%D7%97%D7%99%D7%99%D7%9D_%D7%AA%D7%A8%D7%A2%D7%90"}, {"language": "en", "languageFamilyName": "english", "actualLanguage": "en", "versionTitle": "Wikisource Shulchan Aruch - English", "license": "CC-BY-SA", "versionSource": "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Translation:Shulchan_Aruch/Yoreh_Deah/186"}, {"language": "en", "languageFamilyName": "english", "actualLanguage": "en", "versionTitle": "Rituel du judaïsme, translated by Jean de Pavly with the assistance of M. A. Neviasky. 1898 [fr]", "license": "unknown", "versionSource": "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990024699630205171/NLI"}]}